    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "原本算ヲ失ス但シ之ヲ改メス七合一勺七才ハ六合九勺ナル"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "原本、算を失す。但し之を改めず。七合一勺七才は六合九勺なる。"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Editors' note, set as a two-column warichu beneath the total: the original miscalculates, but we leave it unemended; the figure 7 gō 1 shaku 7 sai should read 6 gō 9 shaku, which would make the total 9,416.3669 koku rather than 9,416.36717."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "校訂註記"
      }
    ],
